"这些计算还没有确认哪些属于正常心跳，因此不标作正常心跳的 SDNN 或 RMSSD。手表约 30 秒的心电，也不能与五分钟或全天的 HRV 直接比较。" = "These calculations have not confirmed which beats are normal, so they are not labeled normal-beat SDNN or RMSSD. A roughly 30-second Watch ECG also cannot be compared directly with five-minute or all-day HRV.";
"Apple 健康中的 HRV 使用 SDNN。你可以单独查看它的趋势；它与本次心电的计算来源不同。" = "Apple Health uses SDNN for HRV. Its trends are available separately; the data source differs from this ECG's calculations.";
"需要至少 12 次波形清楚、完整的心跳，才能画出对比用的参考波形。" = "At least 12 clear, complete beats are needed to draw a reference waveform.";
