"把每次心跳的 R 峰对齐，就可以比较附近波形的高度和形状。参考波形取各位置的中位数，帮助你看清这条记录的典型形状。" = "Aligning each beat's R peak lets you compare nearby waveform height and shape. The reference uses the median at each position to show the record's typical shape.";
"对比范围是 R 峰前 120 ms 到后 160 ms，不包含完整的 P、T 波，也不是 QRS 持续时间的测量。" = "The comparison spans 120 ms before to 160 ms after the R peak. It does not include complete P or T waves and is not a measurement of QRS duration.";
"接触和姿势变化也可能改变波形。波形相似或不同，都不能单独用来判断心电是否正常。" = "Contact and posture changes can also alter the waveform. Similar or different shapes alone cannot determine whether an ECG is normal.";
