"这些数值由应用自动估算，准确度尚未经过真实 Apple Watch 数据验证，不能据此判断心电是否正常。" = "These values are estimated automatically by the app. Accuracy has not been validated on real Apple Watch data, and the values cannot determine whether an ECG is normal.";
"ms 是毫秒，1000 ms 等于 1 秒。mV 是毫伏，用来表示波形相对参考水平线的高低；正数在上方，负数在下方。\n中位数是把测量值从小到大排列后，处于中间的数值。它不是平均值。\n最低–最高展示所有测量值的范围；中间 80% 范围（P10–P90）去掉两端各 10% 的分布，便于看出数值集中在哪里。两者都不是正常范围。\n测量次数以应用识别到的心跳为准，可能有漏检。没有结果的心跳不会填成 0，也不会计入统计。" = "ms means milliseconds: 1,000 ms equals 1 second. mV means millivolts and describes the waveform's level relative to a reference baseline. Positive values are above it; negative values are below.\nThe median is the middle value when measurements are sorted from smallest to largest. It is not the average.\nMin–max covers all measured values. The middle 80% range (P10–P90) excludes the lowest and highest 10% to show where values cluster. Neither is a normal range.\nCounts are based on beats the app identifies; some beats may be missed. Beats without measurements are not replaced with zero or included in statistics.";
"{0} 次：{1}" = "Occurrences: {0}. {1}";
"没有找到足够清楚的心跳波峰，暂时无法分段测量。" = "No sufficiently clear heartbeat peaks were found, so segment measurements are unavailable.";
"这条记录不够细（采样率低于 200 Hz），暂时无法准确找到波形的起止位置。" = "This record's sampling rate is below 200 Hz, so waveform boundaries cannot be located precisely.";
"这段心跳间隔超出当前算法可处理的范围，也可能是波峰识别不准。" = "This heartbeat interval is outside the algorithm's supported range. A peak detection error is also possible.";
"这次心跳附近的波形不完整，或有一段信号不清楚。" = "The waveform around this beat is incomplete, or part of the signal is unclear.";
"波形的参考水平线不够稳定，或干扰较多，暂时测不清。" = "The reference baseline is unstable or there is too much interference for a clear measurement.";
"主要波峰不够突出，难以与干扰区分。" = "The main peak is too faint to distinguish clearly from interference.";
"QRS 附近的波形抖动较多，暂时找不准开始和结束的位置。" = "Noise near QRS makes its start and end difficult to locate.";
"QRS 的开始或结束不清楚，也可能是几个波峰连在了一起。" = "The start or end of QRS is unclear, or several peaks may have merged.";
"这段波形的长度超出算法可处理的范围，暂时不能确认它是 P 波。" = "This wave's duration is outside the supported range, so it cannot be confirmed as a P wave.";
"这个位置已接近 T 波，无法单独测量 ST。" = "This position is too close to the T wave to measure ST separately.";
"P 波太小、起止位置不清，或与旁边的波形重叠。" = "The P wave is too small, its boundaries are unclear, or it overlaps a neighboring wave.";
"没有分辨出这部分波形，因此没有填写数值。" = "This part of the waveform could not be separated, so no value is shown.";
"T 波太小、起止位置不清，或与下一次心跳的波形重叠；记录不完整也会影响测量。" = "The T wave is too small, its boundaries are unclear, or it overlaps the next beat. An incomplete record can also prevent measurement.";
"看不清 T 波从哪里开始，因此无法确定 ST 的测量位置。" = "The T-wave start is unclear, so the ST measurement window cannot be determined.";
"还缺少这次心跳的 QT，或附近连续、稳定的心跳间隔，暂时无法校正。" = "This beat's QT or nearby continuous, stable RR intervals are missing, so correction is unavailable.";
"QT 的结束位置不清，或附近心跳间隔不符合校正条件。具体条件见「测量方法」。" = "The QT end is unclear, or nearby RR intervals do not meet the correction conditions. See Measurement method for details.";
"看不清这次 T 波的结束或下次 P 波的开始，也可能是中间有信号缺口。" = "This T-wave end or the next P-wave start is unclear, or there may be a signal gap between them.";
"缺少上一次心跳、P 波不清楚，或两次心跳之间有信号缺口。" = "The previous beat is missing, the P wave is unclear, or the signal has a gap between beats.";
"目前还不能可靠地把 U 波与 T 波分开。" = "U and T waves cannot yet be separated reliably.";
"需要的起止位置还不够清楚，暂时无法测量。" = "The required start or end point is not clear enough to measure.";
