"检测与评分规则" = "Detection and scoring rules";
"分数表示未被规则标记的心跳比例，不代表健康程度。" = "The score is the proportion of beats not flagged by these rules, not a measure of heart health.";
"本次没有标出早搏候选" = "No premature-beat candidates were flagged in this recording";
