"宽窄分类描述波形特征，不等于已经确认心搏起源。单导联中看不清 P 波时，不推断房性或室性来源。" = "Wide and narrow describe the waveform, not a confirmed site of origin. When P waves are unclear in a single lead, an atrial or ventricular origin is not inferred.";
"规则版本：{0}" = "Rule version: {0}";
"节律参考分" = "Rhythm reference score";
