"节律参考分 {0}" = "Rhythm reference score {0}";
"这次心跳中，没有找到与相邻波形清楚分开的 U 波候选。" = "No U-wave candidate clearly separated from neighboring waves was found in this beat.";
"这个小波形没有在足够多次心跳中重复，暂不作为 U 波候选。" = "This small deflection did not repeat across enough beats to be kept as a U-wave candidate.";
"宽波群早搏候选" = "Wide-complex premature-beat candidate";
"窄波群早搏候选" = "Narrow-complex premature-beat candidate";
"早搏候选，类型待复核" = "Premature-beat candidate, type to review";
"清晰信号不足 20 秒或不足整条记录的 80%，这次不计算分数。" = "There are fewer than 20 seconds of clear signal or less than 80% coverage, so no score is calculated.";
"可复核心跳不足 15 次，或有较多心跳无法可靠比较，这次不计算分数。" = "Fewer than 15 beats can be reviewed, or too many beats cannot be compared reliably, so no score is calculated.";
"稳定的参考心跳不足，本次不计算分数。仅在时序和形态同时支持时标出早搏候选。" = "There are too few stable reference beats to calculate a score. Candidates are flagged only when timing and waveform evidence both support them.";
"心跳间隔变化较大，超出这套评分规则的适用范围。" = "The beat intervals vary too much for these scoring rules to apply.";
"Apple 将这条记录归为房颤或质量不佳，本次不套用早搏分类与节律评分。" = "Apple classified this recording as atrial fibrillation or poor quality, so premature-beat classification and rhythm scoring are not applied.";
"{0} 次已识别心跳中，{1} 次可复核" = "Beats reviewed: {1} of {0} identified";
"{0} 次可复核心跳，{1} 次被标记；同一次心跳只计一次。" = "Reviewable beats: {0}; flagged: {1}. Each beat counts at most once.";
"节律参考分 = 100 ×（1 − 被标记心跳数 ÷ 可复核心跳数），四舍五入。标记包括早搏候选、明显的间隔变化或局部形态变化；早搏后的停顿不重复计数。它描述本条记录中未被规则标记的比例，不是心脏健康分，100 分也不代表心电正常。" = "Rhythm reference score = 100 × (1 − flagged beats ÷ reviewable beats), rounded. Flags include premature-beat candidates, marked interval changes or local waveform changes. The pause after a candidate is not counted again. This describes the share of beats not flagged by these rules in this recording. It is not a heart-health score, and 100 does not mean the ECG is normal.";
"至少需要 20 秒清晰信号、80% 信号覆盖、15 次可复核心跳，以及 8 次稳定的参考心跳。可复核比例需达到非边缘心跳的 80%。信号不足不扣分；PR、QT 缺值和 HRV 高低也不参与加减分。" = "At least 20 seconds of clear signal, 80% signal coverage, 15 reviewable beats and 8 stable reference beats are required. At least 80% of non-edge beats must be reviewable. Poor signal does not reduce the score; missing PR or QT values and higher or lower HRV do not add or subtract points.";
"先与附近心跳比较：提前超过 15% 且至少 80 ms，再检查后续间隔是否延长，或 QRS 是否变宽并改变形态。宽波群候选要求局部宽度至少 120 ms、比参考宽 20%，且模板相关度低于 0.90。窄波群候选要求宽度小于 120 ms、相关度至少 0.90，并伴随后续间隔延长。这些是研究规则，不能单凭它们确认房早或室早。" = "Compare with nearby beats: the beat must arrive over 15% and at least 80 ms early, with a longer following interval or a wider, changed QRS. Wide candidates require a local width of at least 120 ms, over 20% wider than the reference, and template correlation below 0.90. Narrow candidates require a width under 120 ms, correlation of at least 0.90 and a longer following interval. These research rules cannot by themselves confirm atrial or ventricular premature beats.";
"自动识别可能漏报或误报，候选需要结合原图确认。" = "Automatic detection can miss events or flag them incorrectly. Review candidates against the original trace.";
"节律参考分：{0} / 100" = "Rhythm reference score: {0} / 100";
