"U 波候选" = "U-wave candidates";
"T 波之后重复出现的小波形，可能是 U 波。这里只显示与 T 波和下一次 P 波分开的候选，仍需结合原图确认。" = "A small repeated deflection after T may be a U wave. Only candidates separated from T and the next P wave are shown; confirm them on the original trace.";
"小波形也可能来自干扰或 T 波的另一部分；候选不代表已经确认 U 波。" = "A small deflection may also be noise or another part of T. A candidate is not a confirmed U wave.";
"要求 T 波已回到基线，候选与下一次 P 波分开，持续 40–140 ms，幅度不超过 T 波的四分之一，并在至少三次心跳中以相近位置重复。融合或只有一次的小波形不输出结果。" = "T must have returned to baseline, and the candidate must be separate from the next P wave, last 40–140 ms, be no taller than one quarter of T and repeat at a similar position in at least three beats. Fused or isolated deflections are not reported.";
