"等待完整 ECG 分析后计算 HRV。" = "HRV will be calculated after the full ECG analysis.";
"本次来源分类不是窦性心律，暂不估算 HRV。仍可查看上方 RR 间隔。" = "The source classification is not sinus rhythm, so HRV is not estimated. RR intervals remain available above.";
"清晰信号不足，暂不估算 HRV。请保持静止、贴合手表后重新测量。" = "Insufficient clear signal for HRV. Keep still and ensure good watch contact before measuring again.";
"本次节律或波形不够稳定，暂不估算 HRV，避免把不规则心跳当作心率变异性。" = "Rhythm or waveform is not stable enough for HRV estimation; irregular beats must not be mistaken for heart rate variability.";
"剔除干扰和待复核心跳后，需要至少 20 秒且包含 20 个连续间隔才能估算 HRV。" = "After exclusions, HRV needs at least 20 seconds with 20 consecutive intervals.";
"基于本次 ECG 筛选后的连续间隔估算；自动筛选不能确认每次心跳均正常。约 30 秒的结果不与五分钟、全天或 Apple 健康 SDNN 直接比较。" = "Estimated from filtered consecutive intervals in this ECG. Filtering cannot confirm every beat is normal. About 30 seconds is not directly comparable with five-minute, all-day or Apple Health SDNN.";
