"分段测量与波形对比" = "Segment measurements and waveform comparison";
"轻点模块右上角的加号展开。分段测量展示本次记录的数值分布和测量方法；波形对比展示形状差异。" = "Tap the plus in the top right of a section to expand it. Segment measurements show value distributions and methods for this recording; waveform comparisons show differences in shape.";
"节律分析" = "Rhythm analysis";
"查看心跳间隔、节奏变化和提前出现的心跳线索。自动分析只能帮助回看，不能代替诊断。" = "Explore beat intervals, rhythm changes and signs of early beats. Automatic analysis helps you review recordings; it cannot replace a diagnosis.";
"30 秒心电也能估算 HRV。聚集图中每个点代表相邻的两次心跳间隔；越集中，间隔越接近，并非越集中就越健康。" = "A 30-second ECG can estimate HRV. Each dot pairs two consecutive beat intervals. Closer dots mean more similar intervals, not necessarily better health.";
"备忘与分享" = "Notes and sharing";
"记下运动、睡眠或不适，帮助理解测量时的状态。需要时可导出报告。" = "Note exercise, sleep or symptoms to remember how you felt during the measurement. Export a report when needed.";
"随时再看" = "Come back anytime";
"模块旁的信息按钮有更详细的说明。也可以在设置中重新打开使用指南。" = "The information button beside a module explains more. You can also reopen this guide in Settings.";
