"30 秒心电也能估算 HRV。排除干扰和有变化的心跳后，SDNN 使用本次保留的全部间隔；RMSSD 和聚集图只使用原本相邻的间隔，不跨空缺连接。" = "A 30-second ECG can estimate HRV. After removing interference and flagged beats, SDNN uses all retained intervals in this recording. RMSSD and the scatter plot use only originally adjacent intervals, never across gaps.";
"这次清晰的心跳间隔不足。保持静止、贴合手表，再测一次 30 秒心电。" = "There are too few clear beat intervals. Keep still, check your watch's fit, and record another 30-second ECG.";
"这是本次短时测量的 HRV 估算，适合与相同时长、相似状态下的记录比较。" = "This HRV estimate is from a short recording. Compare recordings of the same length taken under similar conditions.";
"更了解自己的心跳" = "Get to know your heartbeat";
"把 Apple 健康里的记录放在一起，轻松回看每天的变化。" = "Bring your Apple Health records together and easily look back at changes from day to day.";
"查看每天的心跳快慢和长期变化。" = "See how fast your heart beats each day and how it changes over time.";
"按日期查找，放大看清每次心电图。" = "Find an ECG by date and zoom in for a closer look.";
"心率变异性（HRV）" = "Heart rate variability (HRV)";
