"轻点右上角可横屏全屏查看。顶部标出测得的波段与间隔，轻点可查看时长；也能放大或用尺子选择两点测量。" = "Tap the top-right button for a landscape full-screen view. Tap a measured wave or interval at the top to see its duration. You can also zoom or use the ruler to measure between two points.";
"支持与联系" = "Support and contact";
"隐私政策" = "Privacy policy";
"无需账号，没有广告或跟踪。健康数据不通过 HeartPro 同步到 iCloud，也不会用于营销。" = "No account, ads or tracking. HeartPro does not sync health data to iCloud or use it for marketing.";
"临时报告在下次打开应用时清理超过 24 小时的副本；清空本地数据也会删除这些副本。已分享的文件由接收人管理。" = "Temporary reports older than 24 hours are removed when you next open the app. Clearing local data also removes these copies. Recipients manage files you have already shared.";
"请在作出医疗决定前咨询医生。" = "Consult a doctor before making medical decisions.";
"使用须知" = "Usage notice";
"使用前，请先了解" = "Before you begin";
"HeartPro 用于整理、浏览和比较已有记录。自动测量、候选标记、参考值及评分只供回看，不构成医疗建议。" = "HeartPro organizes, displays and compares existing records. Automatic measurements, candidate markers, reference values and scores are for reviewing records only, and are not medical advice.";
"不能替代专业医生、诊断、治疗或其他医疗服务。不要依据应用结果自行诊断、开始或停止用药，或延误就医。" = "The app cannot replace a qualified clinician, diagnosis, treatment or other medical services. Do not use its results to diagnose yourself, start or stop medication, or delay seeking care.";
"自动分析尚未经过真实 Apple Watch 记录的独立准确度验证。高分、没有提示或缺少数值都不表示身体健康或没有风险。" = "Automatic analysis has not undergone independent accuracy validation on real Apple Watch recordings. A high score, no marker or a missing value does not establish good health or absence of risk.";
"如有身体不适，请及时就医；持续胸痛、明显气短或晕厥时，请立即联系当地急救服务。不要等待应用分析，本应用不提供急救监测或提醒。" = "If you feel unwell, seek medical attention promptly. For persistent chest pain, severe breathlessness or fainting, contact local emergency services immediately. Do not wait for the app to analyze a recording; it does not provide emergency monitoring or alerts.";
"我已了解，继续" = "I understand, continue";
"参考值仅作一般资料，不根据本次测量推断病因或给出用药、治疗建议。单导联估算可能有误差，不能用于判断健康状况。" = "Reference values are general information. This measurement is not used to infer disease causes or offer medication or treatment advice. Single-lead estimates may contain errors and cannot assess health.";
"不能替代专业医疗" = "No substitute for medical care";
